{"id":"n24805-1-7","stage":2,"title":"찬성 · 赞成","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24805-1-7-1","ko":"오늘 저녁에는 비빔밥을 먹는 게 어때?","zh":"今天晚上吃拌饭怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"저녁에는","meaning":"晚饭，晚餐","explanation":"저녁：晚饭，晚餐；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저녁","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71220","senseId":"2","lemma":"저녁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저녁에는","audio":"/audio/c61c0f2ace4048f6390b.mp3"}},{"text":"비빔밥을","meaning":"拌饭","explanation":"비빔밥：拌饭；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"비빔밥","audio":"/audio/574c26d169130a0860b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71066","senseId":"1","lemma":"비빔밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비빔밥을","audio":"/audio/4e615751744de38c3296.mp3"}},{"text":"먹는","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹는","audio":"/audio/8eed52fccdd9cbc6591a.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryI